sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Người học
  participant C as React client / IndexedDB
  participant TS as ts-fsrs client candidate
  participant API as FastAPI /sync
  participant PY as py-fsrs server candidate
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>C: Chọn Again / Hard / Good / Easy
  C->>C: Tạo event UUID, UTC, model/package version
  opt Parity vectors đã đạt
    C->>TS: Preview local next due
    TS-->>C: Due hint (không phải authority)
  end
  C->>C: Lưu event vào IndexedDB (offline queue)
  C->>API: POST /sync batch + idempotency key
  API->>DB: Verify owner + dedupe event IDs
  API->>DB: Append review_logs
  API->>PY: Replay canonical events nếu package parity đã duyệt
  PY-->>API: Updated state / next due
  API->>DB: Upsert user_cards
  API-->>C: Accepted IDs + conflicts + authoritative state
  C->>C: Cập nhật local cache và xóa accepted events
